{"server":"tw","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_01_end","groupId":"act44side","stageId":"act44side_01","title":"極道作風","storyCode":"AT-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"e5b15d40df8d76d5f14fbd5a3e48363d522630fe95f02175102e7f0618b1406b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"三船在星熊的面前草菅人命，甚至連那封鐵齋寫給星熊的信也是三船偽造的。另一邊，為了拍電視節目，萌萌香不得不去探訪位於鍛冶町的一間怪談四起的“兇宅”，殊不知那裡正是星熊原來居住的地方。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g1_jindastreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（打哈欠）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新口味煎餅，“高級哈密瓜配敘拉古風情紅醬”，還有“甄選濃厚瘤奶配本釀造醬油”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來好好吃哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，熱量，要隨時注意熱量！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？澪小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我馬上就到事務所了。有什麼急事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我馬上過去——跑著過去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g13_directorstudio"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“把粉絲當傻瓜，鼻孔朝天”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“再也不追這個人了，演唱會搞得亂七八糟”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“想炒話題想瘋了，假裝害怕難道不尷尬嗎”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……這是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"輿論攻擊。時間是從昨天凌晨開始。應該是競爭對手所為。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所長，您親自來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事發突然，公關還在查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不光是公關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個“獨角的鬼”，不是我們的人安排上去的，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪，萌萌香的人身安全也是你負責的部分，就拜託你查清這件事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香，比起昨天舞台上的失態，“上面”更不滿意的是另一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一件事……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最近的言行越來越不像是偶像該有的樣子，事後竟然直接消失不見——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時粉絲好像並沒有特別負面的反應，安可的時候我也額外多唱了一首，大家的反應也都還不錯的啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"散場之後，我又累又餓，而且又害怕，就去了一趟常去的那個關東煮攤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你對演唱會上的不當發言又作何解釋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不當發言？！我、我說錯什麼話了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於鍛冶町的發言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鍛冶町？哦，你是說那個粉絲——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們事務所的營運全都靠金石集團的贊助，現在鍛冶町和集團的關係緊張，你貿然表達自己的立場只會讓我們大家很難做人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不瞭解其中的緣由……我原本只想說自己的第一部電影是在那裡拍的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得我最一開始來到這裡的時候，你說是鐵齋社長看中了我的能力……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前是以前，現在是現在。情況已經不一樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，我們一直跟你說，不要說越界的話，老老實實按照寫好的劇本唸。人們想看的是萌萌香，不是亂說話的你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所長……那我們什麼時候去錄音室？今天的行程還蠻滿的，我得再努力一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了。不然你這幾天還是先休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？咦？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所、所長，我沒問題的！我已經調整好了！我知道最近檔期很滿，現在休息的話，之後好幾天的安排都會受影響！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定你昨天白天少做點事，晚上還能鎮定一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉！但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香，如果你真的願意將功補過，這裡有個現成的緊急工作交給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我願意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是電視台剛發來的節目邀請，你看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鍛冶町……鬼屋探訪？！怎麼又是這樣的節目！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且為什麼偏偏要在這個時間點，製作這種對鍛冶町不利的節目……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是想休息囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是！但是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香，你應該知道，不聽我們的，對你的影響更大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所長，我不想死啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就知道那是鬼屋，裡面好像連續死過好幾個人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個鬼屋聽說還跟“無名之鬼”有關係，昨天舞台上的那個就是她……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，萌萌香，我們會保護好你的人身安全的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"事務所所長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1257_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）澪，你也說幾句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……萌萌香，我也會陪你去的，放心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪、澪小姐也去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能打贏那個惡鬼嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"澪歪著腦袋，很認真地想了幾秒鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不一定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完蛋了完蛋了完蛋了完蛋了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g5_kajistreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"“順著仁田街這條大馬路一直走，很快就到鍛冶町了。以後這就是屬於我們的地方，我們的城。”\n“我們的城？可是，爸，一路走過來，我不覺得有什麼不同啊。鐵齋叔，你說呢？”\n“它會變得不同的。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g5_kajistreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"說不清帶著木頭味還是霉味的風撲到臉上，星熊不由自主地深吸了一口氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……房子都變舊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵齋叔還住原來的地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，盡頭的大宅子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金兵衛，所以葬禮到底是怎麼回事？鍛冶町不是還好好的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事說來話長——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"narration","text":"星熊很快意識到金兵衛閉口不言，甚至連臉上的神色都恭敬了幾分的原因。\n不遠處，一位老人正面朝他們站在那裡。\n老人的背已經有些佝僂。風吹起他寬大的袍袖，不知為何，卻只顯得他整個人站得更直了一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵齋叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵齋會長。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金兵衛，我跟你說過，不許再踏進鍛冶町一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"高大的斐迪亞愣了一下，臉上的恭敬轉為惶恐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本想著今天有大喜事，才會失了分寸，無意間進了鍛冶町……當真該死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她和你沆瀣一氣，這就是你所謂的喜事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會長，我只是把她從警局帶來而已。她剛一進御機就被警察抓了進去，剛剛才出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是因為關心情切才趕回來的。您有什麼不滿就衝著我來，千萬別怪罪她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於我擅闖鍛冶町一事，是土下座，是改日正式登門賠罪，還是斷指——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼！我讓你做，你就做嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都聽您的吩咐——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莽撞的黑道","speakerId":"avg_npc_1906_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼……老大！我問了一圈才知道，原來您跑來鍛冶町了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莽撞的黑道","speakerId":"avg_npc_1906_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您親自來這裡做什麼？這老頭已經半隻腳進棺材了，您何必親自來這種鬼地方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莽撞的黑道","speakerId":"avg_npc_1906_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老、老大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還知道我是老大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你知不知道，是誰給了你口中的老大今天這樣尊崇的地位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莽撞的黑道","speakerId":"avg_npc_1906_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對，你也不是第一次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此前鐵齋會長嚴令我和我的手下不得進入鍛冶町，但你不只一次闖進這裡，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莽撞的黑道","speakerId":"avg_npc_1906_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鍛冶町有三戶住家都是被你趕走的，商鋪也有兩家被你搞到搬走的，而且都是在鐵齋會長下令之後，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明知故犯，該當何罪？"},{"type":"narration","text":"莽撞的黑道急得額頭冒汗。\n老大平常不是這樣的，老大是那個自己做得好時和自己把酒言歡，做得差時以溫柔的話語鼓勵的——\n腦中的思緒還沒結束，他忽然聽見一聲響。\n唰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金兵衛，你做什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"思緒在還未結束時就被斬斷，黑道沒了頭顱的身軀撲通一聲倒在地上。\n鐵齋的鐵扇子，星熊的般若，都來不及趕上斐迪亞猛然間抽出的大太刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是你金石會的兄弟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我這個會長面前自相殘殺，你是公然宣布要違逆我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但會中的管教之權，您也已經交到我手中了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不聽勸阻，衝撞會長，屢教不改，他早該死了。容他活到現在，已經是我治理無方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在人已經帶來，我的事情也已經完成了。我違背鐵齋會長命令的事，也該做個了斷。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他把手中沾滿鮮血、尚未納入刀鞘的大太刀對準自己的手指。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在老人開口之前，斐迪亞又是一刀，只見他的左手小指瞬間和手掌脫離，掉在地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣就算兩清了吧？"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒人說話。\n斐迪亞納刀入鞘，朝著鐵齋恭恭敬敬地施了一禮，又對著星熊點了點頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵齋會長，我就不多在您面前礙眼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，歸鄉愉快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去報警——"},{"type":"narration","text":"想起警局裡金兵衛跋扈的樣子，星熊的話沒有說完。\n而老人微微眯起眼睛，看了星熊一眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你在龍門過得不錯。已經不混黑道了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是還在道上，你就不會忘……道上的人無論怎麼死，總是會有人“收拾”的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有人“收拾”，警察就不會願意來管我們這裡的這些破事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旅途勞頓，進屋說話吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g9_higashigarden_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"儘管已闊別二十年，星熊仍然輕車熟路地推門進院。\n和鍛冶町一樣，這裡的時間幾乎沒有流動的痕跡。星熊一眼看見自己以前常走的那條小路，那是穿過庭院最快的方式。\n她甚至不知道是池裡的錦鱗一直活到了現在，還是房屋的主人一直在往池裡補充同樣花色的鱗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g8_tessaihome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……坐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵齋叔，您寫信給我，難道是因為金兵衛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有寫信給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是您？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十年前你離開御機時我就跟你說過，告別之後，永不聯絡。我從來沒想過打破這個諾言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這封信……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金兵衛仿的。還能是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他為什麼要這麼做？您是金石會的會長，怎麼能容忍他肆意妄為？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會長？要不是剛剛那條毒蛇一口一個會長，我都已經忘了自己還是什麼鬼會長了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一句話，我現在只不過是個被架空的老頭，連最後的地盤，你面前這個鍛冶町，也要被人奪走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而金兵衛……哼，我一手創立的源石晶體企業已經徹底被他控制，金石會下面的這些產業現在都在他的手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連電視台和演藝事務所這種生意，都被他做得風生水起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照您這麼說，他幾乎已經佔據了金石會下面所有的產業，還要奪走鍛冶町？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“一場天翻地覆的開發計劃”，一個月前他的原話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於誰開發，怎麼開發，開發收益歸誰，哼，那當然不是我能過問的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您才禁止他和他的人進入鍛冶町。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後就有了今天，他拿手下兄弟的性命演戲給我們看的這一幕……哦，與其說是演戲，倒不如說是立威。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他以前不是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他當年演得太好了，騙過了我，騙過了你。除此之外還有什麼好解釋的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為斷指就不是演戲了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……怎麼演？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"演出道具、斷指再植，甚至最近流行的仿生義肢……他的辦法多的是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那根本就不是什麼“兩清”，那只是侮辱……對我，對整個金石會，對整個極道的侮辱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道金兵衛叫你回來的目的是什麼，但你現在唯一該做的，就是趕快回龍門，再也不要回來。他現在就是條發瘋的牙獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？只要金石會還存在，我還是這個有名無實的會長，金兵衛就不敢光明正大地對我下手。這樣就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你想做什麼？等金兵衛真的把我逼到不得不自盡的時候，幫我結束痛苦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不想再後悔一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去龍門這件事，你終究還是後悔了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我後悔的，樁樁件件都在御機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看著剛剛那個人被金兵衛隨隨便便砍下頭顱的時候，後悔的滋味幾乎快從我的胃裡湧出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對金兵衛背後的人來說，鍛冶町的確就像是御機這件華服上的一塊舊補丁。這不是你一個人能改變的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盡我所能而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也罷，盡是聊這些掃興的事，害我都忘了……般若呢？剛剛金兵衛在的時候我瞥了一眼，好像和當年交到你手裡時有哪裡不一樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個……實不相瞞，被人切斷了一個角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切斷了一個角？用什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劍。"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人剛剛還彷彿看破世情的眼睛裡忽然發出熱切的光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰的劍？什麼材質？劍招如何？還是用了什麼法術？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在龍門的好朋友，好同事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用嘴說太慢了。把般若給我，我看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這——嘖嘖……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是只靠材料先進，或者什麼單純的法術就能砍出來的斷面。天外有天是沒錯，但般若也不是什麼凡俗物件——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……赤霄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵齋叔，您只看斷面就？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了，我也是吃過見過的。跟炎國的貿易代表喝得酒酣耳熱的時候，我也聽說過赤霄的傳聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在赤霄劍下吃虧，對般若而言，不冤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但歸根究柢，赤霄也好，般若也罷，都不是只靠本身的銳利或堅固就成其為神兵利器的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在心性上輸了那個用赤霄劍的，不多，一點點，但這一點點，足以分出勝負。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼看來，金兵衛這封信也不算完全沒用，至少給了般若一次機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要重鑄它？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？我就讓你帶著這面缺了角的盾在龍門到處跑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過……我還得再想想這面盾到底怎麼重鑄，才有勝過赤霄的一線機會……讓我再想想，再想想……"},{"type":"narration","text":"那個山崩於前而面不改色的老頭一下子變了，變成了一個得知人外有人後心癢難耐，非要一較高下不可的年輕人。\n儘管舊識剛剛的那一刀將離愁別緒擊得粉碎，星熊還是在此刻感受到一絲久違的懷念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了，這不是你跟我坐在這裡想就能想通的東西。再給我一點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你被警察審了整整一夜，肯定也睏了。去客房睡一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想……先去祭奠家父。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是你親爹，你跟我道什麼歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那棟診療所，我原來的家，現在還在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐵齋","speakerId":"avg_npc_1895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在，只是從差不多十年前就沒人在住，現在應該已經荒廢得不成樣子了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"鍛冶町北街巷尾，廢棄多年的古宅，是人人口中的“鬼宅”。\n惡鬼消失後，舍弟頭島須一家入住此宅，然而不到三個月，家主染病急逝。\n半年後，當時是若頭補佐的佐野口買下此宅，請大師做法七天七夜後，攜新婚妻子搬入宅邸。\n七日後的深夜，巡警聽見“鬼宅”中傳出悽慘的哀嚎。佐野口夜中發狂，持家傳的寶刀砍死了妻子，隨後自盡而死。\n往後數年，但凡敢住進“鬼宅”的人，沒有一人得以善終，最終，“鬼宅”再無人敢碰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"傳聞說，惡鬼並沒有消失。她的冤魂時不時會出現在“鬼宅”裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼今天……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_oldwarehouse_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡黑漆漆一片，根本看不清楚有什麼東西……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點亮手電筒）澪、澪小姐，你在嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原、原來是飲料罐啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耳機裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香，穩一點，你頭上的攝影機晃得太厲害了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪小姐跑去哪裡了？她說好會來陪我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耳機裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她感冒了，身體不舒服，臨時請假了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認識澪小姐這麼多年，從來沒看過她生病，更不用說去年冬天她在我的面前吃了二十隻冰棒都沒事……這種人怎麼可能感冒啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耳機裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香，我們這樣都是為了節目效果，你配合一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我剛剛在演唱會上遇到了那個惡鬼啊，現在又來探訪她的鬼宅……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耳機裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你放心啦。沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我再往裡面走看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這裡怎麼這麼多飲料罐……嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對……怎、怎麼聲音是從身後傳過來的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰在那裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"惡鬼？幽靈？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你？你來我家做什麼？"},{"type":"narration","text":"萌萌香隨手從地上摸起半截像棍子似的東西對準那團黑影。\n但她很快意識到這種東西對幽靈和惡鬼之類的東西似乎不起作用，慌忙之中把棍子收進懷裡，拿出了一盒……\n炒豆子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"惡鬼，這、這、這個是炒豆子，你敢過來，我就丟你哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼出去！福進來！鬼出去，福、福進……來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"豆子沒用，我這裡還有鹽！你看這是什麼！這是鹽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最……怕……的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起再見我們從來沒有見過我現在就離開給您添麻煩了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，等一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能等啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的頭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒事吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"頭不知撞在什麼東西上的萌萌香原本快要倒地，聽見“幽靈”的呼喊，整個人猛地一震，又突然站了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事——我沒事——對不起，打擾了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我家裡上有……下有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，根本就什麼都沒有——不不不，我還有葉助要等我回去澆水，請你一定放我回去啊求求你了！"},{"type":"narration","text":"情急之下，萌萌香甚至發出了自己在錄音室也從未達到的高音。\n照節目組當天晚些時候的看法，很難說是星熊更像幽靈，還是萌萌香更像發出淒婉哀嚎的冤魂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我腳下的東西是什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你問我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_4202_haruka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是！我沒問你，你放我一個人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前吵吵鬧鬧的女孩子突然消失了，還引起了滿屋的揚塵。\n百思不得其解的星熊靠到旁邊仔細觀察，終於看出了其中的門道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_136_hsguma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地板被她跳塌了一個洞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
